This product includes software developed at xema-dev.

This repository contains reusable, cloud-agnostic Terraform modules for
provisioning the cloud SUBSTRATE a Xema deployment runs on (Kubernetes cluster,
managed databases, DNS, storage class, identity realm). It does NOT contain any
deployment-specific values, credentials, or Terraform state — those live in the
operator's private configuration. See README.md.
